  "details": "Problem Statement\n\nVRChat's world ecosystem suffers from:\n\nAbandoned worlds occupying prime discovery slots indefinitely\n\nOutdated/unbalanced content creating poor experiences for new users\n\n\"Pump and dump\" creators who monetize worlds then disappear\n\nTroll magnets - popular but unmoderated worlds that drive away newcomers\n\nStagnant discovery - same old worlds block new content from visibility\n\nProposed Solution\n\nImplement a monthly maintenance fee for public worlds:\n\nFee amount: $1-2 per month per active world\n\nPayment required to keep world publicly listed\n\nAutomatic delisting after 30 days of non-payment\n\nCreator dashboard showing world performance metrics to justify costs\n\nBenefits\n\nNatural cleanup: Abandoned worlds automatically cycle out\n\nForced maintenance: Creators incentivized to update and balance content\n\nDiscovery rotation: New worlds get visibility as old ones drop off\n\nQuality focus: Only creators committed to their worlds will maintain them\n\nNewbie-friendly: Reduces exposure to broken/toxic environments\n\nCreator accountability: Monetizing creators must stay engaged with their content\n\nImplementation Details\n\nGrace period for existing popular worlds (3-6 months)\n\nReduced rates for educational/community worlds\n\nAnalytics dashboard showing visitor retention to help creators decide\n\nClear communication about world lifecycle to users\n\nThis system ensures only actively maintained, quality worlds remain in public discovery while encouraging creator responsibility.",
